                "field_is_optional_fg": true,
                "field_is_multi_fg": true,
                "field_constraint_data": "REMOVE DISC MATERIAL///REMOVE DISC MATERIAL CREATING ADEQUATE SPACE IN THE ANTERIOR/CONTRALATERAL PORTION OF THE DISC SPACE FOR PLACEMENT OF LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT AND/OR INFUSE|REMOVE SUPERIOR/INFERIOR CARTILAGINOUS ENDPLATES///REMOVE SUPERIOR/INFERIOR CARTILAGINOUS ENDPLATES TAKING CARE TO PRESERVE THE CORTICAL BONY ENDPLATES|PLACE 1 cc OF LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT///PLACE 1 cc OF LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT ANTERIOR/CONTRALATERAL AGAINST ANTERIOR ANNULUS|PLACE INFUSE///PLACE INFUSE ANTERIOR/CONTRALATERAL IN CONTACT WITH PREVIOUSLY PLACED LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT, IF INVESTIGATIONAL SUBJECT|PLACE LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT MAKING SURE TO SURROUND THE INFUSE///PLACE LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT MAKING SURE TO SURROUND THE INFUSE, IF INVESTIGATIONAL SUBJECT|PLACE LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT CONTRALATERAL AND IPSILATERAL CREATING A CHANNEL///PLACE LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT CONTRALATERAL AND IPSILATERAL CREATING A CHANNEL FOR AN OBLIQUELY PLACED CAPSTONE|INSERT LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT-FILLED CAPSTONE SPINAL SYSTEM IMPLANT, ANTERIOR///INSERT LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT-FILLED CAPSTONE SPINAL SYSTEM IMPLANT OBLIQUELY ENSURING, ANTERIOR PORTION CROSSES THE MIDLINE OF THE DISC SPACE|INSERT LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT-FILLED CAPSTONE SPINAL SYSTEM IMPLANT, COUNTERSINK///INSERT LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT-FILLED CAPSTONE SPINAL SYSTEM IMPLANT OBLIQUELY ENSURING, COUNTERSINK THE CAGE >= 3 mm|USE FLUOROSCOPY AND RADIOGRAPHIC MARKERS///USE FLUOROSCOPY AND RADIOGRAPHIC MARKERS TO CONFIRM OBLIQUE PLACEMENT OF CAPSTONE WITHIN THE INTERBODY SPACE|PLACE ADDITIONAL LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT///PLACE ADDITIONAL LOCAL BONE AUTOGRAFT IPSILATERAL/CONTRALATERAL TO CAPSTONE SPINAL SYSTEM IMPLANT UNTIL BONE GRAFT IS FLUSH WITH POSTERIOR ASPECT OF THE INTERBODY DEVICE|IRRIGATE AND SUCTION///IRRIGATE AND SUCTION AS NEEDED ENSURING HEMOSTASIS IS ACHIEVED|ENSURE THAT NO HEMOSTATIC AGENTS OR SEALANTS///ENSURE THAT NO HEMOSTATIC AGENTS OR SEALANTS ARE PLACED POSTERIOR TO THE CAPSTONE SPINAL SYSTEM IMPLANT\n>is_shown_fg=$(surgical_checklist)=='NO'"
            },
